]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "2C">
<servcat sctnbr = "02" scnbr = "03">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A2306005" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "1">
<title>
Rear Coil Spring and Spring Seat Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A2306002">Rear Suspension Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The shock absorber lower bolt is pre-coated with friction stabilizer. If the bolt is reused, it may work loose.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Never reuse the shock absorber lower bolt.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A2306005001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Hoist vehicle and remove rear wheels. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For headlight auto leveling model, disconnect vehicle height sensor from rear axle. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9206016"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Support both ends of rear axle (1) using two floor jacks (2) to prevent it from lowering.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A230007.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.549mm" ver = "01" gw = "209" gh = "141"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear shock absorber lower bolts. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2306003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Lower rear axle gradually if necessary for removing coil spring(s) (1).
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
Lowering the rear axle too much may cause damage to the rear brake flexible hose, wheel speed sensor lead wire and parking brake cable.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Limit the distance that you lower the rear axle to the minimum distance necessary.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove coil spring(s).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A230008.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "70.574mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "184"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove spring upper seat(s) (1) from vehicle body and spring lower seat(s) (2) from rear axle.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A230009.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "75.427mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "197"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A2306005002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A2306006">Rear Coil Spring and Spring Seat Check</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install spring upper seat(s) (1) to vehicle body.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install spring lower seat(s) (2) to rear axle. At this time, fit protrusions (3) of spring lower seat into holes (4) in rear axle.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install coil spring(s) (5) positioning identification painting to the lower side. At this time, contact coil spring end (6) with protrusion (7) of spring lower seat as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
To avoid abnormal noise from rear suspension, position spring seats and springs correctly.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A230010.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "93.238mm" ver = "01" gw = "189" gh = "248"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Left side
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[f]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Vehicle forward
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Right side
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[u]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Vehicle upward
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Jack up rear axle and then connect shock absorber (1) lower end to rear axle at each of right and left sides.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten new shock absorber lower bolt(s) (2) temporarily by hand.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A230011.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "74.102mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "194"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove floor jack from rear axle.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For headlight auto leveling model, install vehicle height sensor to rear axle. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9206016"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install rear wheels. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Lower hoist and bounce vehicle up and down several times to stabilize suspension.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten shock absorber lower bolt(s) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T2C003">
<t-part>
Rear shock absorber lower bolt
</t-part>
<t-value1>
90
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
9.2
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
66.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check rear wheel alignment. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2306001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
